# Agnos Hospital Information System (HIS) API

A RESTful API service for managing hospital patients and staff, built with Go, Gin, and PostgreSQL.

## Tech Stack

- **Language**: Go 1.25
- **Framework**: Gin
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 16 (via GORM)
- **Auth**: JWT (golang-jwt/jwt v5)
- **Migration**: Goose
- **Container**: Docker / Docker Compose

## Project Structure

```
.
├── api/
│   ├── handler/        # HTTP handlers (staff, patient)
│   ├── middleware/     # JWT auth middleware
│   ├── presenter/      # Response models
│   └── routes/         # Route registration
├── cmd/
│   └── main.go         # Entry point
├── internal/
│   ├── config/         # Environment config loader
│   ├── database/       # GORM connection setup
│   └── repository/     # GORM repository implementations
├── migrations/         # SQL migration files (Goose)
├── nginx/              # Nginx reverse proxy config
└── pkg/
    ├── hospital/       # Hospital domain (entity, repo, service, usecase)
    ├── patient/        # Patient domain
    └── staff/          # Staff domain
```
